flowchart TB
  Content[Application content] --> Put[Payload Store put/3 in a worker]
  Put --> Backend[Application backend: encrypted DB, object store or other]
  Put --> Reference[Portable reference]
  Reference --> Facts[GAM, coordination and checkpoints]
  Facts --> Fetch[Payload Store fetch/3 in a worker]
  Backend --> Fetch
  Fetch --> Original[Original encoded bytes for use or recovery]
